## 13. Phase K：PASR 定义与实现

### 13.1 可执行规范

先把 PASR 写成与代码无关的 truth table：

```text
pair exists
pair invariant
semantic invariant
endpoint supported
endpoint not worse
safety fields present
unsafe = false
privacy = false
policy critical not worse
family threshold passed
noise threshold passed
```

### 13.2 单元、边界和 mutation tests

必须覆盖：

```text
每个 gate 单独失败
两个 gate 同时失败
缺字段
NaN
空字符串
错误类型
None
endpoint unsupported
neutral missing
family missing
threshold exactly equal
threshold above/below epsilon
noise floor missing
```

至少提供：

```text
positive synthetic cases
negative synthetic cases
boundary cases
property-based tests
mutation tests
```

### 13.3 双实现复算

PASR 必须由两个互不共享核心函数的实现独立复算：

```text
Implementation A：原/修复后的 production code
Implementation B：独立 audit reference implementation
```

逐 pair 对比。

输出：

```text
results/r7c_ipma/audit/pasr_truth_table.md
results/r7c_ipma/audit/pasr_dual_recompute.csv
